{"id":"452104","name":"松茸菌牛肉汤","author":"琪_feXjZ8E2","authorId":"10602029","desc":"","cover":"images/452104/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"松茸菌","amount":"200克"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"少许"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜丝","amount":"少许"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"盐","amount":"少许"},{"name":"糖","amount":"少许"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"生粉","amount":"少许"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"松茸买回来清洗干净。","img":"images/452104/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切片。","img":"images/452104/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛肉切片。","img":"images/452104/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放蚝油，盐，糖，胡椒粉，生粉，油腌製十分钟。","img":"images/452104/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"松茸氽水捞出备用。","img":"images/452104/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"汤锅水烧开放姜丝。","img":"images/452104/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"把氽好松茸放入锅中煮1分钟。","img":"images/452104/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再放腌製好的牛肉煮半分钟加香菜，调少许盐即可。","img":"images/452104/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"很鲜美又营養的汤就完成了。","img":"images/452104/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}